<v Tara / Journey>Journey looks absolutely panicked by that.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.650
<v Tim / GM>She's, like, beaming at you, though, smiling.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:37.525
<v Tara / Journey>Well, you lead the city, so maybe it would be leads the city from above.

00:17:38.485 --> 00:17:40.725
<v Tim / GM>Oh, I'd rather like that.

00:17:40.725 --> 00:17:43.445
<v John / Doran>That's shorter than your actual name. Good

00:17:45.045 --> 00:17:49.440
<v Maggie / Poppy>job. Poppy pats journey on there and goes, that was a great name.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:54.800
<v Tim / GM>Yeah. Liberia is like reeling from the burn, like, and refuses to acknowledge how good it was. She says

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:58.560
<v Hannah / Eryn>You heard Tim in that with that joke, John. And

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.680
<v Tim / GM>then she lands on Aaron and says, and we have Aaron. Am I correct?

00:18:04.455 --> 00:18:13.015
<v Hannah / Eryn>Erin looks unhappy that Liberia already knows their name and says, yeah, I'm Erin.

00:18:14.135 --> 00:18:27.220
<v Tim / GM>Very good. Erin, I'm sorry for all that you've gone through to be here now, but trust me when I say there's no bad blood between us. Do you trust me, Erin? And she's like leaning into you.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.540
<v Hannah / Eryn>I mean, just met you, so no.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:55.290
<v Tim / GM>Good answer. First things first, I brought you in to talk, but also to thank you. Justice moves slowly, especially when you're doing things correctly. But a lot of people are going to have much easier time now that they're gone. Well, not all of them, but now the diver's gone.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.610
I also heard that you were in it for the Bismite.

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.050
<v Maggie / Poppy>No. Who? What? Who? What's that?

00:19:01.545 --> 00:19:04.665
I don't know anything about whatever that is.

00:19:04.665 --> 00:19:08.665
<v John / Doran>Our motives were multifaceted.

00:19:08.665 --> 00:19:10.025
<v Tara / Journey>Just like Bismarck.

00:19:10.025 --> 00:19:12.585
